{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Am nevoie de o secțiune Shopify (Liquid section) pentru un banner hero complet customizabil, optimizată pentru traduceri (compatibilă cu Shopify Translate & Adapt, Localize etc.).
    
    CERINȚE GENERALE:
    - Toate textele (titlu, subtitlu, CTA) trebuie să fie definite în schema și să suporte traducere (nu hardcoded).
    - Folosește `t` filter sau schema fields standard astfel încât să fie detectate de aplicațiile de traducere.
    - Cod curat, modern, fără dependențe externe.
    
    IMAGINI:
    - 2 image pickers separate:
      - imagine desktop
      - imagine mobile
    - Responsive logic:
      - desktop image pentru >768px
      - mobile image pentru <=768px
    
    TEXT:
    - Titlu
    - Subtitlu
    - CTA text
    - CTA link
    
    CONTROL AVANSAT (FOARTE IMPORTANT):
    Vreau controale fine în schema pentru:
    
    LAYOUT:
    - poziție text (left / center / right)
    - aliniere verticală (top / center / bottom)
    - max width pentru content
    - spacing (padding top/bottom)
    
    TIPOGRAFIE:
    - font size separat pentru:
      - titlu (desktop + mobile)
      - subtitlu (desktop + mobile)
      - CTA (desktop + mobile)
    - font weight
    - line height
    
    CULORI:
    - culoare titlu
    - culoare subtitlu
    - culoare CTA
    - culoare background buton
    - culoare hover buton
    
    OVERLAY:
    - overlay activ/inactiv
    - culoare overlay
    - opacitate overlay (range slider)
    
    BUTON:
    - stil buton:
      - outline
      - solid
    - border radius
    - padding
    
    ALTE DETALII:
    - opțiune pentru dark gradient overlay (jos sau lateral)
    - suport pentru text shadow (on/off)
    - border radius pentru banner
    - hover subtle effect (zoom imagine sau fade)
    
    RESPONSIVE:
    - layout optimizat pentru mobile
    - control separat pentru poziționare text pe mobile
    
    STRUCTURĂ:
    - folosește best practices Shopify sections
    - include `{% schema %}` complet
    - cod semantic și performant
    - fără inline styles excesive dacă nu e necesar
    
    SCOP:
    Vreau o secțiune premium, flexibilă, care poate fi reutilizată pentru homepage hero sau category banners, și care funcționează perfect cu traduceri multi-language.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-hero-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.banner_border_radius }}px;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-hero-banner__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: {{ block.settings.banner_height_desktop }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-hero-banner__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.6s ease;
  }

  {% if block.settings.hover_effect == 'zoom' %}
    .ai-hero-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-hero-banner__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-hero-banner__image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-hero-banner__overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  {% if block.settings.overlay_enabled %}
    .ai-hero-banner__overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      background-color: {{ block.settings.overlay_color }};
      opacity: {{ block.settings.overlay_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
    }
  {% endif %}

  {% if block.settings.gradient_overlay_enabled %}
    .ai-hero-banner__gradient-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 2;
      {% if block.settings.gradient_direction == 'bottom' %}
        background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.gradient_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }}), transparent);
      {% elsif block.settings.gradient_direction == 'top' %}
        background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.gradient_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }}), transparent);
      {% elsif block.settings.gradient_direction == 'left' %}
        background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.gradient_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }}), transparent);
      {% elsif block.settings.gradient_direction == 'right' %}
        background: linear-gradient(to left, rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.gradient_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }}), transparent);
      {% endif %}
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-hero-banner__content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 3;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.content_max_width }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.content_padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.content_padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.content_padding_bottom }}px;
    
    {% if block.settings.text_position_horizontal == 'left' %}
      left: 0;
      text-align: left;
    {% elsif block.settings.text_position_horizontal == 'center' %}
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      text-align: center;
    {% elsif block.settings.text_position_horizontal == 'right' %}
      right: 0;
      text-align: right;
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.text_position_vertical == 'top' %}
      top: 0;
    {% elsif block.settings.text_position_vertical == 'center' %}
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      {% if block.settings.text_position_horizontal == 'center' %}
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      {% endif %}
    {% elsif block.settings.text_position_vertical == 'bottom' %}
      bottom: 0;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-hero-banner__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.title_spacing }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_font_weight }};
    line-height: {{ block.settings.title_line_height }};
    {% if block.settings.text_shadow_enabled %}
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-hero-banner__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.subtitle_spacing }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.subtitle_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subtitle_font_weight }};
    line-height: {{ block.settings.subtitle_line_height }};
    {% if block.settings.text_shadow_enabled %}
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-hero-banner__cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.cta_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.cta_font_weight }};
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
    
    {% if block.settings.button_style == 'solid' %}
      background-color: {{ block.settings.button_background_color }};
      color: {{ block.settings.cta_color }};
      border: 2px solid {{ block.settings.button_background_color }};
    {% elsif block.settings.button_style == 'outline' %}
      background-color: transparent;
      color: {{ block.settings.cta_color }};
      border: 2px solid {{ block.settings.cta_color }};
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-hero-banner__cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    {% if block.settings.button_style == 'solid' %}
      background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_color }};
      border-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_color }};
      {% if block.settings.hover_effect == 'fade' %}
        opacity: 0.9;
      {% endif %}
    {% elsif block.settings.button_style == 'outline' %}
      background-color: {{ block.settings.cta_color }};
      color: {{ block.settings.button_background_color }};
    {% endif %}
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-hero-banner__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: {{ block.settings.banner_height_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-hero-banner__image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-hero-banner__image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: block;
    }

    .ai-hero-banner__content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      {% if block.settings.text_position_horizontal_mobile == 'left' %}
        left: 0;
        right: auto;
        transform: none;
        text-align: left;
      {% elsif block.settings.text_position_horizontal_mobile == 'center' %}
        left: 50%;
        right: auto;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        text-align: center;
      {% elsif block.settings.text_position_horizontal_mobile == 'right' %}
        left: auto;
        right: 0;
        transform: none;
        text-align: right;
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.text_position_vertical == 'center' %}
        top: 50%;
        {% if block.settings.text_position_horizontal_mobile == 'center' %}
          transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        {% else %}
          transform: translateY(-50%);
        {% endif %}
      {% endif %}
    }

    .ai-hero-banner__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-hero-banner__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-hero-banner__cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.cta_size_mobile }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<hero-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-hero-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-hero-banner__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.image_desktop %}
      <img
        src="{{ block.settings.image_desktop | image_url: width: 2000 }}"
        alt="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.alt | escape }}"
        loading="lazy"
        width="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.width }}"
        height="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.height }}"
        class="ai-hero-banner__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-hero-banner__image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
      >
    {% else %}
      <div class="ai-hero-banner__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-hero-banner__image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ 'hero-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.image_mobile %}
      <img
        src="{{ block.settings.image_mobile | image_url: width: 1000 }}"
        alt="{{ block.settings.image_mobile.alt | escape }}"
        loading="lazy"
        width="{{ block.settings.image_mobile.width }}"
        height="{{ block.settings.image_mobile.height }}"
        class="ai-hero-banner__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-hero-banner__image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
      >
    {% else %}
      <div class="ai-hero-banner__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-hero-banner__image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ 'hero-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.overlay_enabled %}
      <div class="ai-hero-banner__overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.gradient_overlay_enabled %}
      <div class="ai-hero-banner__gradient-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-hero-banner__content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.title != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-hero-banner__title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.title }}</h2>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.subtitle != blank %}
        <p class="ai-hero-banner__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subtitle }}</p>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.cta_text != blank and block.settings.cta_link != blank %}
        <a href="{{ block.settings.cta_link }}" class="ai-hero-banner__cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.cta_text }}
        </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</hero-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class HeroBanner{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.style.display = 'block';
      }
    }

    customElements.define('hero-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }}', HeroBanner{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Hero banner",
  "tag": null,
  "class": "hero-banner-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Images"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image_desktop",
      "label": "Desktop image"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image_mobile",
      "label": "Mobile image"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "banner_height_desktop",
      "min": 300,
      "max": 900,
      "step": 50,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Desktop height",
      "default": 600
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "banner_height_mobile",
      "min": 200,
      "max": 700,
      "step": 50,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Mobile height",
      "default": 400
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "banner_border_radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Border radius",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Text content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "Premium LED Lighting"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "subtitle",
      "label": "Subtitle",
      "default": "Discover contemporary home fixtures"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cta_text",
      "label": "Button text",
      "default": "Shop now"
    },
    {
